- `cache/probiotics-aad-prevention/snapshots/2026-09-15r2-search_v2/records.json`: `records` (each with id, id_type, pmid, nct, doi,
  title, abstract, journal, year, pubtypes, found_by) and `screening.decisions` (decision, rule_id, reason, span).
